1
00:04:13,846 --> 00:04:19,846
Can you survive five nights?

2
00:08:27,692 --> 00:08:33,692
Five Nights at Freddy's is a horror, thriller film directed by Emma Tammi.

3
00:12:41,538 --> 00:12:47,538
Recently fired and desperate for work, a troubled young man named Mike agrees to take a position as
a night security guard at an abandoned theme restaurant: Freddy Fazbear's Pizzeria.

4
00:16:55,384 --> 00:17:01,384
But he soon discovers that nothing at Freddy's is what it seems.

5
00:21:09,230 --> 00:21:15,230
Mike, played by Josh Hutcherson.

6
00:25:23,076 --> 00:25:29,076
Abby, played by Piper Rubio.

7
00:29:36,923 --> 00:29:42,923
Vanessa, played by Elizabeth Lail.

8
00:33:50,769 --> 00:33:56,769
Steve Raglan / William Afton, played by Matthew Lillard.

9
00:38:04,615 --> 00:38:10,615
Aunt Jane, played by Mary Stuart Masterson.

10
00:42:18,461 --> 00:42:24,461
Max, played by Kat Conner Sterling.

11
00:46:32,307 --> 00:46:38,307
Five Nights at Freddy's is a 2023 American supernatural horror film
based on the video game series created by Scott Cawthon.

12
00:50:46,153 --> 00:50:52,153
It was directed by Emma Tammi, and written by Cawthon, Tammi and Seth Cuddeback.

13
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
The film stars Josh Hutcherson as a troubled security guard who starts a job at an abandoned pizzeria where he discovers its
animatronic mascots are possessed by the souls of murdered children who were abducted by a serial killer decades before.

14
00:59:13,846 --> 00:59:19,846
The film also stars Elizabeth Lail, Piper Rubio, Mary Stuart
Masterson, and Matthew Lillard feature in supporting roles.

15
01:03:27,692 --> 01:03:33,692
Development of a Five Nights at Freddy's film adaptation
began in April 2015 under Warner Bros.

16
01:07:41,538 --> 01:07:47,538
Roy Lee, Seth Grahame-Smith, and David Katzenberg were set to produce
it, with Gil Kenan announced as director and co-writer.

17
01:11:55,384 --> 01:12:01,384
After multiple production delays, Kenan resigned from the project and
further development on the film was transferred from Warner Bros.

18
01:16:09,230 --> 01:16:15,230
to Jason Blum's Blumhouse Productions in March 2017.

19
01:20:23,076 --> 01:20:29,076
Chris Columbus was hired to direct and write the film in February 2018, ultimately
leaving the project and being replaced by Tammi in October 2022.

20
01:24:36,923 --> 01:24:42,923
Principal photography occurred from February to April 2023
in New Orleans and surrounding communities.

21
01:28:50,769 --> 01:28:56,769
Five Nights at Freddy's was simultaneously released for streaming on Peacock and
theatrically in the United States on October 27, 2023, by Universal Pictures.

22
01:33:04,615 --> 01:33:10,615
The film received generally negative reviews from critics and was a commercial success, grossing
$292–$297 million on a budget of $20 million and becoming Blumhouse's highest-grossing film.

23
01:37:18,461 --> 01:37:24,461
A sequel, Five Nights at Freddy's 2, was released in 2025.

24
01:41:32,307 --> 01:41:38,307
The film explores themes of night shift, child murder,
restaurant, custody battle, child in peril.

25
01:45:46,153 --> 01:45:52,153
The tone is dark and intense.
